You may find yourself on the losing end of a fight... but fleeing from combat is not as simple as picking a direction!
If you try to walk out of the room where you are fighting, you may receive a message like this:
   A Nabian guard blocks your attempt to leave.
You have a couple options to get away from the fight. First is to CRASH out of the room (this is the ESCAPE ability, which is easily learned with 5 lessons in Skirmishing). The other option is to hinder your opponent with attacks that will, for example, entangle or paralyze them, after which you can leave the room.